{'symbol': 'CZR', 'date': '2022-12-21 11:20:00', 'title': "CASINO METRO AND CAESARS SPORTSBOOK LAUNCH SPORTS BETTING AT PUERTO RICO'S LARGEST CASINO", 'text': 'SAN JUAN, PUERTO RICO , DEC. 21, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CASINO METRO, PUERTO RICO\'S LARGEST CASINO,\xa0TODAY\xa0ANNOUNCED\xa0THE OPENING OF ITS SPORTSBOOK\xa0WITH CAESARS SPORTSBOOK,\xa0A DIVISION OF CAESARS ENTERTAINMENT, INC. (NASDAQ: CZR) ("CAESARS"). THE\xa0PARTNERSHIP\xa0BRINGS\xa0CAESARS SPORTSBOOK\'S\xa0ELEVATED RETAIL SPORTS BETTING PRODUCT TO CASINO METRO\'S GUESTS\xa0WITH PLANS TO LAUNCH THE CAESARS SPORTSBOOK MOBILE APP IN PUERTO RICO IN 2023, SUBJECT TO REGULATORY APPROVALS.'}